  "solution": "**Symbol**\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n÷\n\n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n**Meaning**\n\n \n \n \n-\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n×\n\n \n \n \n÷\n\n \n \n \n\nGiven expression: 66 ÷ 11 (12 > 4) + 5\n\nAfter replacing the symbols by their meaning, we get:\n\n66 + 11 × 9 ÷ **__(12 __****__÷__****__ 4)__** - 5\n\n= 66 + 11 × __**9 ÷ 3**__ - 5\n\n= 66 + **__11 __****__× 3__** - 5\n\n= __**66 + 33**__ - 5\n\n= 99 - 5\n\n= 94\n\nHence, '**94**' is the correct answer.",
